      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "It has come to my attention that Commissioners and Department heads have, on occasion, been offered honorariums by private organizations or Agencies of the State or Federal Government for speaking engagements, participation in seminars, or other public appearances. I do not believe it appropriate to accept such honorariums. Accordingly, if an honorarium is received following a public appearance, it should either be returned, or sent to a private charity, and the sender so notified.",
